1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,520
When you give people your time, they think you're always free,

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,100
but they rarely see how often you show up for them.

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,780
Do it enough, and it starts to feel normal,

4
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:13,640
and your value quietly fades away.

5
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:16,020
That's the harsh reality of life.
